<title>HONG KONG: C.Lyonnais ups Guangdong Inv warrants.</title>
<headline>C.Lyonnais ups Guangdong Inv warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd said on Monday it has increased the American style call warrants on shares of Guangdong Investment Ltd to 770 million warrants from 360 million warrants.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$6.21	 PREMIUM	    14.0 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$0.1656     GEARING	    4.16X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	23.APR.98     PAYDATE	    12.MAY.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE PRICE HK$6.90	 LISTING DATE     14.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   HONG KONG     MIN EXER LOT     20,000</p>
<p> NOTES	     CASH OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY AT ISSUER'S</p>
<p>		     DISCRETION.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
